sequenceDiagram
    participant Customer as Existing customer tab
    participant Staff as Account-switching tab
    participant API as Local API
    participant Storage as Browser storage event
    Note over Customer,Staff: Same browser profile shares one session cookie
    Staff->>API: Sign out, then sign in as staff
    API-->>Staff: Updated shared session cookie
    Staff->>Staff: Set current session, cancel older requests
    Staff->>Storage: Publish random invalidation marker
    Storage-->>Customer: Account changed in another tab
    Customer->>Customer: Clear workspace and CSRF and abort pending requests
    Customer->>Customer: Cancel poll timers and reject late responses
    Note over Customer: Show sign-in and session-change explanation
    Staff->>API: GET staff ticket, claim, reply
    API-->>Staff: Team-authorized ticket and conversation
    Note over Customer,API: Customer ownership checks remain enforced
